<div style="text-align: center;">
<p><em><a href="https://youtu.be/pjZ-Ba8VuWw">subjective and short sighted</a></em><br />
<em><a href="https://youtu.be/pjZ-Ba8VuWw">your words when they ridicule mine</a></em><br />
